{"server":"tw","storyId":"act45side_level_act45side_08_end","groupId":"act45side","stageId":"act45side_08","title":"童話的開場","storyCode":"SS-8","avgTag":"行動後","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/tw/gamedata/story/activities/act45side/level_act45side_08_end.txt","sourceHash":"a68071695fd4298b45114249cbbea7f92f00d88aeb134ada351ed6572260cc5d","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"一場酣暢淋漓的演奏後，Ave{@nbs}Mujica的大家終於回到了夢城堡。鬧劇終將收場，Ave{@nbs}Mujica會作為Ave{@nbs}Mujica繼續存在著。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i12"},{"type":"narration","text":"最後一個音符落定，祥子的手仍停留在鍵盤上。\n空蕩蕩的城堡裡，還縈繞著方才音樂的微弱迴響。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……小，祥……？"},{"type":"narration","text":"許久未聞，卻又再熟悉不過的聲音在她的身旁響起。她緩緩抬起了頭。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真的……終於……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……終於見面了呢，小祥。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"感覺好像做了一個很長很長的夢，差點醒不過來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"小祥，我們真的繞了一大圈，差點又要錯過了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"而站在祥子面前的，除了初華，還有其他的樂隊成員。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"就好像被人拉了一把，然後就出現在了這裡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀~幹嘛突然這麼認真啦？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥，你現在笑得很開心。"},{"type":"narration","text":"頭頂的聚光燈閃爍著，晃得祥子有些睜不開眼，也讓眼前的一切都顯得那麼不真實，就像是又踏入了另一場夢。\n但她知道，她知道的——\n她們再一次合奏了屬於她們的歌。\nAve{@nbs}Mujica的大家，終於回來了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯！當然，我現在很開心……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"初華……睦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"若麥……海鈴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我真的……很想你們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"各位——歡迎回來。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（掙扎的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就是這些傢伙讓我們昏睡的吧？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夢境，沒有用了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……不行……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們不能離開……你們必須……留在這裡！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（尖銳的嘶鳴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——大家小心！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾夫！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲絲，別再錯下去了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"別拿你剛從書裡學到的話教訓我！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，你帶著她們——呃！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"沃爾夫話音未落，密密麻麻的絲線瞬間刺穿了它的雙臂，一縷縷棉花從孔洞中湧了出來。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊！快點看天上——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"不計其數的卡爾頓在頭頂的天空中紛飛，織出一張巨大的夢網。\n夢網一點點朝少女們逼近，而且越來越大。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲絲……別再執迷不悟了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一把巨大的剪刀從空中落下，夢網瞬間被剪碎成了一根根飄搖的絲線，散落在空中，紛紛揚揚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（慌亂的嘶鳴聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是誰？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"唔——！"},{"type":"narration","text":"少女在空中抽搐了兩下，緊接著從高空落下，速度越來越快——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我、我們得救了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這到底是怎麼回事……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"抱歉，我們來晚了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"愛、愛麗絲小姐……！幸虧有你的幫忙，謝謝。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"見到熟悉的仙女，鬆了一口氣的同時，一股無法抗拒的倦意襲來，祥子感覺自己的身體不受控制，整個人徑直地向地面倒去。\n沉悶的聲音響徹整個大廳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥——！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"祥子……祥子……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"（是誰……這次又是誰……）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"五感一點點地恢復，祥子隱約聞到了一股淡淡的香味。\n緩緩睜開眼，她發覺自己正躺在柔軟的絲絨沙發上，而身旁坐著一位棕髮的少女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊，你醒了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你穿梭了太多次夢境，身體實在無法承受負荷，所以才暈倒了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不過作為完全沒有接觸過這類源石技藝的人，你能堅持那麼久已經非常讓人意外了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那其他人……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用擔心，我已經為她們安排好了房間，貝娜正在陪著她們。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對了，我好像還沒有正式向你介紹自己——我叫愛麗絲，是夢城堡的現任主人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們在夢裡已經見過了許多次……如果這是我們的第一次相見，那之前的你又是誰？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已經見過了莫菲絲的能力——夢城堡的仙女中有一群特別的人，擁有罕見的造夢源石技藝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這種能力並非無所不能，施術者創造的夢境始終受限於她對被施術者的認知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲絲一開始並不瞭解你，也並沒有將你視為勢均力敵的對手，所以才會創造出那個有瑕疵的夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至於你為什麼會見到我，我想，應該是外婆的功勞吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"外婆？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，外婆是夢城堡的上一任主人。她因為身體不好，現在一直在一間隱蔽的房間裡休養。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她之前送了我一條項鍊，但這幾天項鍊裡面的能量一直都很躁動，保險起見，我和貝娜連夜趕了回來……沒想到發生了這麼嚴重的事故。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原來……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"cg_rainsplash"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"好心的老婦人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那邊剛剛發生了一點事，你一個人過去很危險，還是繞路吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"戴著帽子的少女","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"……謝謝提醒。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"41_g5_siestaunbuiltland_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我聽附近的老奶奶說……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"34_g1_victoriavillage"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"和善的鎮民","speakerId":"avg_npc_243","isRemote":false,"text":"你快點回去吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"賣花的婦人","speakerId":"avg_npc_1255_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夜黑燈暗，小心不要再迷路了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐，身為夢城堡的主人，我為發生的這一切向你道歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但莫菲絲做了那樣過分的事，你也很難原諒她吧……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不……我本來應該要怨恨她的沒錯，但現在心中好像並沒有這種情緒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……什麼？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"其實正如她所說，Ave{@nbs}Mujica從來都不是一個緊密相連的團體。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我一開始同意和她打賭，只是想要儘快把樂隊成員帶回來，並不算是冷靜的判斷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但當我進入每個成員的夢境，然後被她們一一拒絕時，我才發現自己根本不瞭解她們的內心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在她創造的夢裡，我們每個人都只想用看似美好的那面去掩蓋內心最脆弱的部分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我有嘗試去瞭解這些曾與我日夜相處的夥伴嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我做好承擔其他人人生的覺悟了嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在“無夢之境”的深淵墜落時，我無數次這樣質問自己。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子小姐……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而當我終於解開心結，將我的夥伴們一個個喚醒，再次站在莫菲絲的面前時，除了最初的憤怒，還有一種莫名的情緒……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一種發自內心的悲傷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那一刻，我和她四目相對。我突然意識到，我的力量不再單薄，我還有身邊的夥伴。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而她的身邊，依然只有她一人，和那些完全遵循她的意志的造物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她是造夢的人，她比我們任何一人都還清楚，夢境裡的一切都是虛假的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但她依然選擇沉溺在一個又一個的夢境裡，一定也有她的難言之隱吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_mini02_victoria_street_n"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈哈哈，你是沒有心的怪物！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"難怪你爸媽都不要你！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你活不過這個冬天的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不對，你們胡說！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你們快點走開！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哦——快跑！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲絲，你還好嗎？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愛麗絲姐姐，他、他們說的是真的嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"他們是壞孩子對吧？仙女們是不會給他們美夢的，對吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我不是沒有心的怪物，不是被父母拋棄的，我能活過這個冬天的，對吧？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲絲……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"愛麗絲姐姐，回答我！！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g11_lentinobleroom_indoor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"出於某些原因，莫菲絲只能在夢城堡生活。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這片大地並不像童話一般美好。莫菲絲曾經歷的苦難，讓她無法相信童話中的那些美夢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我也深知，夢城堡的美夢並不能解決所有的問題……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“和現實比起來，我們的能力實在有限。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“我們能做的，不過是在孩子們內心的最深處，留下一顆種子。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“它可能是年少時，心裡覺得最重要的一件事，抑或是一個物品。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“它不會時刻強調自己的存在，但它會在關鍵的時刻、一個人最脆弱的時刻，給予他力量。”"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你說的這些……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"這些都是夢境裡的你對我說的哦，愛麗絲小姐。現在，我把這些也說給你聽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我想，或許莫菲絲也在等待著某個夢境，讓她真正地“長大成人”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"月亮升起之時，人偶獲得生命——你看，月亮不是已經升起來了嗎？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"愛麗絲看向窗外，清冷的月光透過城堡的窗，溫柔地灑在了她和祥子的身上。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，你說得對。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，愛麗絲小姐，我還有一個請求……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"請說，我一定盡全力幫你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雖然我們五個人都從夢境裡甦醒了，但我們好像並沒有回到我們原本的那個世界……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然愛麗絲小姐是夢城堡的主人，或許你知道怎麼樣才可以讓我們回去？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你昏迷時，我聽過她們描述你所說的那個“世界”。從她們的形容來看，的確不像是泰拉的某個城市。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但你們的情況我的確從來沒有遇到過，就算翻遍城堡的資料庫也一無所獲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我準備求助一下羅德島——羅德島的博士很有學識，應該能找到將你們送回去的辦法。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“羅德島”……那個醫藥公司？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是的，你在夢裡也見過羅德島嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也想再去拜訪那裡，還有幾個“老朋友”也想見見……欸……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼了，祥子小姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……我有點想不起來她們的模樣了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"面對正在困惑的祥子，愛麗絲好像早有預料一樣，輕輕地捧起了她的手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"經歷過了這麼多人的夢境，祥子小姐，你應該很熟悉夢城堡的規則了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"正如所有的夢境一樣，從醒來的那一刻開始，關於它的記憶就在一點點地模糊消散。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"終有一天，你會回到屬於你的“世界”，到那個時候，你會忘記我，忘記夢城堡的美夢，忘記泰拉的一切。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼會這樣……！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但這裡發生的一切並非毫無作用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回去以後，也許你和你的同伴又要重新解決你們的問題……但我相信你們一定會成功的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"即使你忘記了在這裡發生的一切，你也會記得，自己面對困難時的勇氣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也相信……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回到了原來的世界，Ave{@nbs}Mujica也會作為Ave{@nbs}Mujica繼續存在著。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"身為夢城堡的主人，我會永遠記得你們現在“孩子”的模樣。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可能某一天，我會再次出現在長大的你們的面前呢——希望到那個時候，你和你的夥伴仍在用音樂書寫你們的人生。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們約好了！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"門外是什麼聲音……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不會又有人在搗亂吧？！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_g2_dreamcastlehall"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子快步打開了房門。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小祥——你終於醒了，你還好嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莽撞的卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（暈乎乎的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我沒事……為什麼外面會突然冒出這麼大的聲音？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我們正在布置新的舞台，貝娜小姐就讓莫菲絲操控這些小傢伙搬東西……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"新的舞台……？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"對啊，也不知道我們還要在這裡待多久，不如趁有空多排練一下吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想要練習的曲子還有很多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"八幡海鈴","speakerId":"avg_4186_tmoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"本來莫菲絲想直接在夢境裡創造一個新的舞台，但被我們和貝娜小姐否決了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我這段時間都不想再做夢了……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我也一樣……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們就沒有人關心一下我嗎——為什麼要我來當苦力啊！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（憤怒的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"narration","text":"站在莫菲絲身旁的貝娜並沒有多說什麼，只是伸出了手，用力彈了一下莫菲絲毛茸茸的耳朵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊——痛痛痛！！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（慘兮兮的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫菲絲，既然犯錯了，就應該接受相應的懲罰……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沃爾夫，你也別想逃，你去把最後的那盞燈裝上去！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我……好的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"在眾人的面前，沃爾夫雙手伏地，很快變成了獸形。\n它輕鬆地叼起燈的電線，輕輕一躍，將燈穩穩地掛在了上面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎麼樣，新的舞台還滿意嗎？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真好看啊——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"若麥飛快地跑上了舞台，在一個個精緻的布景間來回穿梭。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哼，這種事簡簡單單啦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你是不是忘了最重要的樂器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哎呀，不要再彈我的耳朵了，我馬上拿出來啦！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"就在莫菲絲摀著耳朵時，台上已經出現了每個人的樂器，大家紛紛走上台。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"若葉睦","speakerId":"avg_4183_mortis_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，還是和以前一樣順手。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"祐天寺若麥","speakerId":"avg_4185_amoris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（希望夢裡荒廢的那段時間不會影響到現實的肌肉記憶——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"三角初華","speakerId":"avg_4184_dolris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祥子，我們都準備好了，你也來吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子抬頭看向台上的同伴們，燈光已經匯聚在了她們身上，而熟悉的鍵盤，也在呼喚著她的回歸。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"愛麗絲","speakerId":"avg_338_iris_1","isRemote":false,"text":"期待你們的表演，祥子小姐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"貝娜","speakerId":"avg_369_bena_1","isRemote":false,"text":"之前沒機會欣賞你們完整的演出，現在可以彌補遺憾了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"卡爾頓們","speakerId":"avg_npc_1937_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（開心的哼唧聲）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"沃爾夫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1938_1","isRemote":false,"text":"能以非敵人的身分聆聽你們的演奏，對我來說是最欣慰的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你們怎麼都在說一些客套話！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"總、總之……我會豎起耳朵聽的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"噗……哈哈哈哈哈哈哈……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫菲絲","speakerId":"avg_npc_1942_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你笑什麼啊！不要以為愛麗絲姐姐和貝娜姐姐在，我就不敢做什麼……"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"沒什麼……哈哈，我上台了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"祥子抓住了隊友伸來的手，走上了屬於Ave{@nbs}Mujica的舞台。\n就像拼圖拼完了最後一塊，也許結果並沒有那麼令人驚喜，但唯有這一刻，一切才變得完整和圓滿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":"avg_4182_oblvns_1","isRemote":false,"text":"各位，在這片大地上，留下屬於我們的聲音吧！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"65_i13"},{"type":"narration","text":"月光灑下之時，人偶獲得暫時的生命。\n人偶的皮囊之下，藏著少女們的秘密。\n愛意，恐懼，悲傷，死亡，遺忘。\n在夢的城堡中，秘密與罪孽融合復活。\n高舉燭台，踏破荊棘，撥開迷霧。\n新的童話，就此孕育。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"這便是我們這些人偶的奇遇故事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"豐川祥子","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"歡迎來到……Ave{@nbs}Mujica的世界。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
